# Hardware-run bulk output.  New run directories under artifacts/ and captures/
# are not committed: they are per-run dumps of live calls, and the corpus is
# already large.  Fixtures the tests read (artifacts/eicon-digital-downstream/,
# artifacts/eicon-phase4-downstream/, the reneg/goal replay recordings, ...)
# are ALREADY TRACKED, and .gitignore does not affect tracked files, so they
# keep working; `git add -f` a new one that a test needs to read.
